    <briefdescription>
<para>many-body part for the Embedded <ref refid="structAtom" kindref="compound">Atom</ref> Method descriptor. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><formula id="33">\[ V_i = F\Bigg(\sum_{j \neq i} \rho(r_{ij}) \Bigg) \]</formula></para>
<para>This descriptor will load tabulated values for the density <formula id="28">$ \rho $</formula> and embedded energy <formula id="34">$ F $</formula> from the provided <ref refid="classConfig_1SETFL" kindref="member">SETFL</ref> file.</para>
<para>This descriptor is usually used together with the two-body descriptor <ref refid="classD2__EAM" kindref="compound">D2_EAM</ref> although this is not required and user can mix it with any other descriptors or use it on its own.</para>
<para>This descriptor will enforce cutoff distance as specified in a <ref refid="classConfig_1SETFL" kindref="member">SETFL</ref> file. Set <ref refid="classConfig_1RCUTMB" kindref="member">RCUTMB</ref> to the same value to suppress the warning message.</para>
<para>Required <ref refid="classConfig" kindref="compound">Config</ref> keys: <ref refid="classConfig_1INITMB" kindref="member">INITMB</ref> <ref refid="classConfig_1SETFL" kindref="member">SETFL</ref> </para>
